# Only genuinely non-source artefacts are excluded here.
#
# Guideline 4 requires public access to the source of any compiled asset and
# to the build tools that produce it, so the JSX/CSS sources under
# assets/*/src, package.json, package-lock.json and webpack.config.js all
# SHIP alongside the bundles in assets/build/. composer.json ships for the
# same reason: vendor/ holds the generated autoloader.
#
# node_modules is the one build input left out - it is reinstallable from
# package-lock.json and would add tens of megabytes.

.git
.gitignore
.distignore
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

node_modules

*.log
*.zip
